    "Minutes buy talk time with your fluent self. Reviewing your words, drills, and dialogues always stays free." : {
      "comment" : "A footer text in the \"Plan & talk time\" tab of the \"Me\" tab, explaining that the free access to reviewing your content is a perk of using the app for free.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
