    "People we invented to practice with — different jobs, places and ways of talking." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erfundene Leute zum Üben — verschiedene Berufe, Orte und Sprechweisen."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "練習用に作った架空の人たちです。仕事も、住む場所も、話し方もそれぞれ違います。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "연습용으로 만든 가상의 사람들이에요 — 직업도, 사는 곳도, 말투도 제각각이에요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這些是我們虛構的練習對象，職業、住的地方和說話方式各不相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "People we invented to practice with — each one in the middle of something they'll want to talk about." : {
      "localizations" : {
