    "Recording again during setup is free, and the voice you have now is only replaced if you keep the new one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定中は録音し直しても無料です。新しい声を選んだときだけ、今の声が置き換わります。"
